  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blended Finance Investment Facility - Promissory Notes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will provide risk capital to a Development Finance Institution through a new blended finance facility to support Pakistan&#x2019;s climate change mitigation, adaptation, and resilience building. The value add of this facility is in its role in building evidence and nurturing markets for innovative businesses or investment vehicles. This could include providing early-stage support to new climate technologies and business models, including nascent adaptation and resilience and decarbonisation solutions. The facility will focus on both direct mobilisation and in-direct mobilisation (demonstration effect and catalysing markets), using concessional finance to address the higher risks and costs faced to pioneer new technologies or business models to crowd-in DFI and private capital. The facility&#x2019;s two overarching priorities will be climate adaptation and gender, aligned with the Adaptation and Resilience Investors Collaborative (ARIC).</narrative>
  </description>
